{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Talking About the Future", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Dreaming Big", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 14, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Describe hypothetical situations in written and spoken interactions according to work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Future Continuous and Future Perfect Tenses vs. Regular Future Tenses", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">Future Continuous tense</span> to talk about something happening at a particular time in the future.<br/>You use the <span class=\"strong\">Future Perfect tense</span> to talk about an action in the future before another action in the future. This is the past in the future. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The structure of the <span class=\"strong\">Future Continuous </span> is: <br/>Subject + <span class=\"italic\">will</span> + <span class=\"italic\">be</span> + verb <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The structure of the <span class=\"strong\">Future Perfect </span>is: <br/>Subject + <span class=\"italic\">will </span>+ <span class=\"italic\">have </span>+ past participle", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Look at the chart for a comparison of the other tenses used to talk about the future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Name\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Use\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\">The Modal Will</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"when you talk about things that are not decided, make a decision at the moment of speaking for the future or make predictions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">There <span class=\\\"strong\\\">will</span> also be memory foam seats that  morph into the perfect fit. <br/><span class=\\\"strong\\\">I'll</span> have pineapple juice.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Be going to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"when you talk about intentions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Traveling in the future <span class=\\\"strong\\\">is going to be</span> a lot more luxurious than it is now.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Continuous</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"when you talk about things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked for the future\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I just can't wait until <span class=\\\"strong\\\">we are sitting</span> by the pool sipping fruit cocktails. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Simple Present</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"when you talk about schedules\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The plane <span class=\\\"strong\\\">lands</span> in about 10 minutes.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Future Continuous</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the action will have started before that moment but it will not have finished at that moment\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm so happy we <span class=\\\"strong\\\">won't be wearing</span> winter coats!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Future Perfect</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"like the Present Perfect tense, but instead of your viewpoint being in the present, it is in the future\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">By the time that happens, <span class=\\\"strong\\\">I will have perished</span>.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Traveling in the future is going to be a lot more luxurious than it is now.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Will you be having a beverage?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I'm so happy we won't be wearing winter coats!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I will have stopped traveling because I'll be ancient.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Did you know that people will be flying in planes with a panoramic view? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "By the time the flight is over, I'll have fallen for someone!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Also we won't be cooking or cleaning or working! ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Gerunds", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When a verb ends in <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span>, it may be a present participle or it may be a gerund.  ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you use a verb + <span class=\"italic\">ing</span> form more like a verb or an adjective, it is usually a <span class=\"strong\">present participle</span>:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Vanessa is <span class=\"strong\">shopping</span>.<br/>The movie is <span class=\"strong\">exciting</span>.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When we use a verb in <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span> form more like a noun, it is usually a <span class=\"strong\">gerund</span>:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Shopping</span> is fun.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You should think of a gerund as a verb in noun form.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Like nouns, gerunds can be the subject or object of a sentence:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Sitting</span> in the middle doesn't bother me. <br/>I will have stopped <span class=\"strong\">traveling</span> because I'll be ancient.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Gerunds are sometimes called \"verbal nouns\".", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Flying is not my favorite pastime!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Traveling in the future is going to be a lot more luxurious than it is now.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I will have stopped traveling because I'll be ancient.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Being on holidays is so wonderful!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Sitting in the middle doesn't bother me. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "panoramic", "type": "name"}, {"content": "giving an unobstructed view of an extensive area in all directions", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Did you know that people will be flying in planes with a panoramic view?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear about changes in the future.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "memory foam", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a material that is sensitive to pressure and temperature", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Apparently, there will also be memory foam seats. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to morph into", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to gradually change into a different stage", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  Foam seats will  morph into the perfect fit. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to hesitate", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to pause or wait in uncertainty", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Please don't hesitate to ask.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to spray", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to disperse a liquid in a jet of droplets or particles", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They will spray sleep hormones.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "hormones", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a substance produced by one tissue and conveyed by the bloodstream to another to carry out bodily functions", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Sleep hormones will be sprayed on passengers so they sleep and rest.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "panic attack", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an intense attack of anxiety characterized by feelings of impending doom and despair", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'll have had a panic attack.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob02aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "wealth of knowledge", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a great deal of knowledge about a subject or many subjects", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I didn't know you were such a wealth of knowledge.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob02aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Share your predictions for the future of your country with a friend.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask your friend about their predictions for the future of your country.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Find out about 3 or 4 other people's predictions for the future of your country.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a journal entry including a prediction that each person made. Say if you think it will happen or not and why.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I talk about the future of my country.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask others to make predictions about our/their country.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I discover other people's predictions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write and share my journal entry about the predictions, and correct any errors.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about emotions, personal qualities and behavior.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about future action.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about what I will be doing or what I will have done.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What will traveling in the future be like?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What will you be doing at this time next year?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Where are you going on vacation?", "type": "free_ty