ssa</span>: For long flights, they will spray sleep hormones so everyone will be able to arrive well-rested, especially after a long overseas flight.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn9le14ob02re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: This sounds great, but by the time that happens, I will have perished, or I will have stopped traveling because I'll be ancient.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, I think we will experience some of it. Also I hope that by the time it happens, the earth won't have been destroyed by climate change or war.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I didn't know you were such a wealth of knowledge V. I just can't wait until we are sitting by the pool sipping fruit cocktails.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  I'm so happy we won't be wearing winter coats! Also we won't be cooking or cleaning or working! Being on holidays is so wonderful!", "id": 2, "time": "40000", "image": "engenn9le14ob02re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Steward</span>: Will you be having a beverage?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh yes. I'll have pineapple juice.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: And I'll have water.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Thanks.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Steward</span>: Please don't hesitate to ask.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: By the time the flight is over, I'll have fallen for someone!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Or I'll have had a panic attack.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It's just a bit of turbulence. You'll be fine.", "id": 3, "time": "76000", "image": "engenn9le14ob02re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn9le14ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le14ob02re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}